# MAP.md and BACKLOG_OPEN.md are fully GENERATED (scripts/build-map.mjs / build-backlog-index.mjs)
# and are regenerated on nearly every PR, so they conflict by construction on a busy day (NEW-1).
# `merge=planyr-ledger` hands any 3-way merge of these two paths to a custom driver that
# reconciles both sides and regenerates, instead of asking a human to.
#
# The driver's actual COMMAND lives in local git config (`merge.planyr-ledger.driver`), not here —
# `.gitattributes` is committed, but merge.<name>.driver is a per-clone setting git refuses to
# store in the repo. It is wired automatically by `npm install` / `npm run hooks:install`
# (scripts/install-hooks.mjs — the same self-installer that arms the mint-gate pre-push hook).
#
# If a conflict on either file ever shows ordinary git markers instead of resolving itself, the
# local config is missing: run `npm run hooks:install` (or `node scripts/install-hooks.mjs --check`
# to confirm) and see scripts/merge-driver-ledgers.mjs.
MAP.md merge=planyr-ledger
BACKLOG_OPEN.md merge=planyr-ledger
